---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import StatusBar from '../components/StatusBar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { contact } from '../data/nav.js';

const p = 'mt-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-acw-ink';
---

<Layout title="Accessibility statement">
  <StatusBar placement="band" />
  <Header />
  <StatusBar placement="strip" />

  <main id="main">
    <div class="border-b border-acw-rule bg-acw-tint/40">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-16">
        <p class="caps text-[11px] text-acw-green">ADA accessibility statement</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[32px] leading-tight font-medium text-acw-deep">
          Committed to an inclusive digital experience
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-acw-muted">
          Accessibility is a priority, not an option.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-16">
      <p class={p}>
        We believe the internet should be usable by everyone, regardless of ability or circumstance.
        Amon Carter Lake Water Supply Corporation is committed to making this website work for the
        broadest possible audience.
      </p>

      <p class={p}>
        To support that commitment, we aim to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG)
        2.1, Level AA. These internationally recognized guidelines set out best practices for making
        digital content usable by people with a wide range of disabilities.
      </p>

      <p class={p}>
        We aim to support a broad range of browsers and assistive technologies, so members can use the
        tools that work best for them.
      </p>

      <p class={p}>
        Accessibility is an ongoing process. Some areas of this site may not yet be fully optimized,
        and we are actively working toward full compliance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 font-heading text-[20px] font-medium text-acw-deep">
        Tell us if something isn't working
      </h2>

      <p class={p}>
        If you run into an accessibility problem on this site, or have a suggestion, we want to hear
        about it. Email
        <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`} class="font-medium text-acw-green hover:underline">{contact.email}</a>
        or call the office at
        <a href={contact.office.tel} class="font-medium text-acw-green hover:underline">{contact.office.display}</a>,
        and we will get you the information you need another way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>